<title>UK: CSFB sets warrants on a basket of Japanese stock.</title>
<headline>CSFB sets warrants on a basket of Japanese stock.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-02-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>Credit Suisse First Boston, Zurich, said it has issued one million American-style call warrants, on a basket of Japanese quality stocks.</p>
<p>The basket includes shares of Kao Corporation, Takeda Chem. Ind, Fuji Photo Film, Bridgestone Corp, Matsushita Electric Ind, Sharp Corp, Sony Corp, TDK Corp, Kyocera Corp, Mitsubishi Heavy, Toyota Motor Co, Honda Motor Co, Canon Inc, Ricoh Co. Ltd and Dai Nippon.</p>
<p> STRIKE PRICE    11300 YEN		 PREMIUM	13.20 PCT</p>
<p> ISSUE PRICE     11.90 CHF		 GEARING	11.0 X</p>
<p> EXERCISE PERIOD 06.MAR.97-14.JUL.98   PAYDATE	05.MAR.97</p>
<p> LISTING	   NONE			MIN EXER LOT 100</p>
<p> SPOT REFERENCE  10855 YEN	 JPY/CHF 83.40</p>
<p>--Reuter London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
